# Ancient Greenwarden's third ability (CR 603.2, 603.6a): a land entering causes a triggered ability of a permanent its
# controller controls to trigger an additional time. Bot1 casts it on turn 1 off four mana sources; its own land,
# Adventurer's Inn, enters the same turn, so the Inn's "you gain 2 life" triggers twice and Bot1 is at 24, not 22.
# Its Reach (CR 702.17) is why it may block Bot2's flying Ornithopter on turn 4, which its 5 power kills.

[Bot1 Deck]
Ancient Greenwarden
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Adventurer's Inn
Forest x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ancient Greenwarden.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Adventurer's Inn.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 24
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Ancient Greenwarden > Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 24

[Expect]
Turn = 4
Bot1.Life = 24
Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Greenwarden.Power = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Greenwarden.Toughness = 7
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
